{"id":"43afe63c-e5e5-4d2b-8436-12c9703d7ba7","revision":0,"last_node_id":30,"last_link_id":35,"nodes":[{"id":1,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[0,-420],"size":[3360,360],"flags":{},"order":0,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"properties":{},"widgets_values":["## Arbor · Storyboard to video with sound — pictures, text and audio in one tree (MiniMax H3)\n\nThree trees with the same shape drive one batch of clips: the **keyframes** (Load Folder: one named branch per scene, from *arbor_qwen_storyboard*), a **motion** line per shot, and a **sound** line per scene.\n\n1. **Expression** `x + \" Sound: \" + y` — the motion lines live on the shots, the sound line once per scene: matched by path, every shot of a scene gets that scene's sound. H3 generates picture **and** audio from it.\n2. **XY Lists** (only *x*) flattens the keyframes; the prompts come out of the Expression's *data* in the same order, so each clip gets its own first frame and its own prompt.\n3. A second **Expression** builds a file name per clip from the tree itself — `\"arbor/h3/\" + str(b) + \" · \" + name + \"/shot_\" + str(i + 1)` (*name* is the scene, *i* the shot) — and **Save Video** files every clip into its scene's folder.\n4. **Batch Pick** `0, -1` keeps the first and last frame of every clip; **Construct Tree** with the keyframe tree as its *structure* groups them by scene again → an **Image Grid** contact sheet, one row per scene.\n\nClips are 56 frames (~2.3 s) at 0.3 MP to keep the demo quick — raise *length* and the resolution for real shots. Run *arbor_qwen_storyboard* first, or point Load Folder at your own folder of folders."],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"## Arbor · Storyboard to video with sound — pictures, text and audio in one tree (MiniMax H3)\n\nThree trees with the same shape drive one batch of clips: the **keyframes** (Load Folder: one named branch per scene, from *arbor_qwen_storyboard*), a **motion** line per shot, and a **sound** line per scene.\n\n1. **Expression** `x + \" Sound: \" + y` — the motion lines live on the shots, the sound line once per scene: matched by path, every shot of a scene gets that scene's sound. H3 generates picture **and** audio from it.\n2. **XY Lists** (only *x*) flattens the keyframes; the prompts come out of the Expression's *data* in the same order, so each clip gets its own first frame and its own prompt.\n3. A second **Expression** builds a file name per clip from the tree itself — `\"arbor/h3/\" + str(b) + \" · \" + name + \"/shot_\" + str(i + 1)` (*name* is the scene, *i* the shot) — and **Save Video** files every clip into its scene's folder.\n4. **Batch Pick** `0, -1` keeps the first and last frame of every clip; **Construct Tree** with the keyframe tree as its *structure* groups them by scene again → an **Image Grid** contact sheet, one row per scene.\n\nClips are 56 frames (~2.3 s) at 0.3 MP to keep the demo quick — raise *length* and the resolution for real shots. Run *arbor_qwen_storyboard* first, or point Load Folder at your own folder of folders."},"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":2,"type":"Arbor_LoadFolder","pos":[0,0],"size":[420,200],"flags":{},"order":1,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"文件夹","name":"folder","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"folder"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"文件匹配","name":"pattern","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"pattern"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"子文件夹","name":"subfolders","type":"BOOLEAN","widget":{"name":"subfolders"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"排序","name":"sort","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"sort"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"数量上限","name":"limit","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"limit"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"图像","name":"images","type":"ARBOR_TREE","links":[4,5,32]},{"localized_name":"文件名","name":"names","type":"ARBOR_TREE","links":null},{"localized_name":"文件夹","name":"folders","shape":6,"type":"STRING","links":null},{"localized_name":"数量","name":"count","type":"INT","links":null}],"title":"Keyframes","properties":{"Node na